title: "timescales: Nested Timeframes and Calendars for Optimization and Simulation Models"
abstract: >-
  Discrete time representations for optimization and simulation models,
  including calendar-based nested sets of timeframes, conversion between
  alternative temporal resolutions, and mapping of data onto calendar grids
  for modeling and visualization.
